      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Coronary arteriography maintains a major role in the management of patients with stable and unstable anginal syndromes, in the establishment of diagnosis and prognosis, and in guiding the choice of therapeutic alternatives. Included in this article are discussions of assessment of coronary artery disease, and coronary arteriography in patients with stable and unstable angina pectoris."},
